WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.130
The local volume.

00:01.778 --> 00:06.289
Forty million light-years out, our group is one knot among eight hundred galaxies.

00:06.785 --> 00:08.885
Most of their distances have been measured.

00:09.467 --> 00:15.249
The fainter grey-blue points are only estimates: their direction is known, their depth is not.
